NOTES.local.md

# Emitted beside sources by a stray non-build tsc invocation. These must never exist: Vite resolves
# `./packages/x/src` to `index.js` BEFORE `index.ts`, so a stale emit silently shadows the source and
# every test keeps passing against old code.
packages/*/src/**/*.js
packages/*/src/**/*.d.ts
packages/*/src/**/*.map
